  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 35 new plugins and 769 official stars, with 490,627 npm weekly downloads; desktop projects led growth, as dataelement/dsh-desktop gained 340 stars. However, 13,003 of 16,459 tracked plugins have been stale for 7 days, and the official 0.2.0-rc.1 release makes activity and migration worth watching.",
    "zh": "过去 8 小时新增 <b>35</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>769</b> 星，npm 周下载 <b>49 万</b>；桌面端仍是热度中心，dataelement/dsh-desktop 单窗口涨 <b>340</b> 星领跑。不过 <b>16459</b> 个追踪插件里有 <b>13003</b> 个已 7 天无更新，官方刚放出 0.2.0-rc.1，建议持续观察生态活跃度与版本迁移节奏。"
